{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Lost Mixtape is a game about playing a raccoon who just discovered a Portable Cassette Player. Roam an abandoned mall and its surroundings to collect scattered music tapes to play on your newly acquired portable device. Rummage through trash, unlock secret paths, and gather items while every new tape adds to your personal soundtrack, turning exploration into a music-filled short exploration game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander parking lots, abandoned shops and areas reclaimed by nature</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden paths and find your way in this world filled with trash</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the environment and collect items you find along your way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012050/extras/f6ee98b40cd664695fa47a1aeaac25b9.poster.avif?t=1769443388\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012050/extras/f6ee98b40cd664695fa47a1aeaac25b9.webm?t=1769443388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012050/extras/f6ee98b40cd664695fa47a1aeaac25b9.mp4?t=1769443388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- LISTEN TO MUSIC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new tapes at your own rhythm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy your new tracks with headphones or not!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012050/extras/5837478524c8ccd520835c5f1843f285.poster.avif?t=1769443388\" width=614 heigh